 (PDT)"},{"name":"From","value":"fbeaufort@chromium.org"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] Re: Safari 10 - Programmatic Cut and Copy Support"}]}}]},{"messages":[{"snippet":"Hi all, BlinkOn 6 is only a couple days away! If you&#39;re too excited to wait, you can view the","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Dru Knox <dknox@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 14 Jun 2016 02:44:44 -0700"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] BlinkOn 6 Schedule"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev+announce@chromium.org"}]}}]},{"messages":[{"snippet":"Hi blink-dev! Finally, it&#39;s time to remove OwnPtr completely. I have a local patch touching ~1500","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Yuta Kitamura <yutak@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 14 Jun 2016 16:04:30 +0900"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] PSA: OwnPtr removal is planned on this Sunday (June 19)"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Hello! I landed the patch a while ago, and it seems to be working pretty well, modulo some slow bots","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Yuta Kitamura <yutak@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Sun, 19 Jun 2016 18:10:37 +0900"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] Re: PSA: OwnPtr removal is planned on this Sunday (June 19)"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Woohoo! Great job. Let&#39;s hope it sticks! On Sun, Jun 19, 2016 at 11:10 AM, Yuta Kitamura &lt;","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Charles Harrison <csharrison@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Sun, 19 Jun 2016 11:18:11 +0200"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Re: PSA: OwnPtr removal is planned on this Sunday (June 19)"},{"name":"To","value":"Yuta Kitamura <yutak@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"You did it :D Congrats! On Sun, Jun 19, 2016 at 6:18 PM, Charl