upport these","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Ian Kilpatrick <ikilpatrick@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Mon, 23 May 2016 09:44:08 -0700"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"To","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"\"blink-dev@chromium.org\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Hi Ian, To answer your questions: 1) Yes, it is not implemented in WebKit trunk however originally a","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"\"'Ian Kilpatrick'\" <ikilpatrick@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev@chromium.org"},{"name":"Subject","value":"RE: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 24 May 2016 11:40:19 +0100"}]}},{"snippet":"Hi Anton, Thanks for taking the time to reply, it always helps having more insight. Other vendors -","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Ian Kilpatrick' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 24 May 2016 11:58:36 -0700"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"To","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"The use case here (enabling customization of spatial navigation behavior) does seem valuable to me,","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Wed, 25 May 2016 19:55:31 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"To","value":"Ian Kilpatrick <ikilpatrick@google.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Hi Anton, This is a question in general about the spec itself, not for your intent to implement, but","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Takayoshi Kochi <kochi@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 11:31:54 +0900"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"To","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"\"blink-dev@chromium.org\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Hi Rick, Thanks for the search – but I guess your search didn&#39;t include TV broadcast applications","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"\"'Rick Byers'\" <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"\"'blink-dev'\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>, Simon Waller <simon.waller@samsung.com>"},{"name":"Subject","value":"RE: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 27 May 2016 14:53:39 +0100"}]}},{"snippet":"A few of us chatted about this at BlinkOn. If I recall the general conclusions were: 1) The TV","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 21 Jun 2016 14:29:56 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: CSS3 nav-up/down/left/right properties"},{"name":"To","value":"Anton Obzhirov <a.obzhirov@samsung.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>, Simon Waller <simon.waller@samsung.com>, ikilpatrick@chromium.org, Elliott Sprehn <esprehn@chromium.org>, Kent Tamura <tkent@chromium.org>"}]}}]},{"messages":[{"snippet":"Blink bug status as of 2016-05-23 Component Open Unconfirmed Untriaged Pri-0/1 No owner Oldest Whole","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"TAMURA, Kent\" <tkent@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Mon, 23 May 2016 08:34:48 +0900"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] Blink bug status as of 2016-05-23