 Ship: Do not perform default action on un-trusted events"},{"name":"To","value":"Ashley Gullen <ashley@scirra.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Dave Tapuska <dtapuska@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Oh, I didn&#39;t know click() worked. Never mind then! On 11 May 2016 at 18:51, PhistucK &lt;phistuck","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"Date","value":"Wed, 11 May 2016 18:53:59 +0100"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Ship: Do not perform default action on un-trusted events"},{"name":"From","value":"Ashley Gullen <ashley@scirra.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"PhistucK <phistuck@gmail.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Dave Tapuska <dtapuska@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"To me this looks more like an intent to deprecate &amp; remove than an intent to ship? On Wed, May 11","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Jochen Eisinger <jochen@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Wed, 11 May 2016 20:39:05 +0000"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Ship: Do not perform default action on un-trusted events"},{"name":"To","value":"Dave Tapuska <dtapuska@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Can we treat it as an intent to deprecate based on the discussion? I will send out a separate intent","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"Date","value":"Wed, 11 May 2016 16:44:39 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Ship: Do not perform default action on un-trusted events"},{"name":"From","value":"\"'Dave Tapuska' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"To","value":"Jochen Eisinger <jochen@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"sgtm! On Wed, May 11, 2016 at 10:44 PM Dave Tapuska &lt;dtapuska@google.com&gt; wrote: Can we treat","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Jochen Eisinger <jochen@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Wed, 11 May 2016 20:47:13 +000