n, Anssi\" <anssi.kostiainen@intel.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"CC","value":"\"Bhaumik, Rijubrata\" <rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com>, Tobie Langel <tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com>, Paul Bakaus <pbakaus@google.com>, Alex Russell <slightlyoff@google.com>, Paul Kinlan <paulkinlan@google.com>"},{"name":"Subject","value":"[blink-dev] Re: Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 28 Apr 2016 08:27:07 +0000"}]}},{"snippet":"Hey all, Your local TAG member here! We&#39;ve taken a first read here: https://github.com/w3ctag/","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Alex Russell <slightlyoff@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 28 Apr 2016 10:53:11 -0700"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"},{"name":"To","value":"\"Bhaumik, Rijubrata\" <rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>, Tobie Langel <tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com>, Anssi Kostiainen <anssi.kostiainen@intel.com>"}]}},{"snippet":"Hi, Based on feedback we&#39;ve received from initial review for the patches that Riju sent and","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 3 Jun 2016 05:37:20 -0700 (PDT)"},{"name":"From","value":"Alexander <alexander.shalamov@intel.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com, tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com, anssi.kostiainen@intel.com, slightlyoff@chromium.org"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"}]}},{"snippet":"The abstraction looks good but I&#39;m concerned that the use of shared memory here is a bit of","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Reilly Grant <reillyg@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 03 Jun 2016 18:28:51 +0000"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"},{"name":"To","value":"Alexander <alexander.shalamov@intel.com>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com, tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com, anssi.kostiainen@intel.com, slightlyoff@chromium.org"}]}},{"snippet":"Thank you for looking Reilly. We used shared memory to reduce IPC latency for sensors like Gyroscope,","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"Date","value":"Mon, 6 Jun 2016 03:04:04 -0700 (PDT)"},{"name":"From","value":"Alexander <alexander.shalamov@intel.com>"},{"name":"To","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"alexander.shalamov@intel.com, rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com, tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com, anssi.kostiainen@intel.com, slightlyoff@chromium.org"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"}]}},{"snippet":"Seems strange that avoiding IPC would be necessary for eg. Gryroscope but not for touch events (both","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Mon, 6 Jun 2016 11:22:08 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"},{"name":"To","value":"Alexander <alexander.shalamov@intel.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>, \"Bhaumik, Rijubrata\" <rijubrata.bhaumik@intel.com>, tobie@sensors.codespeaks.com, \"Kostiainen, Anssi\" <anssi.kostiainen@intel.com>, Alex Russell <slightlyoff@chromium.org>, Tim Dresser <tdresser@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"See also the Intent to implement and ship Device Motion API, where shared memory was introduced. /m","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Michael van Ouwerkerk <mvanouwerkerk@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Mon, 6 Jun 2016 17:18:35 +0100"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement: Generic Sensor & Ambient Light Sensor APIs"},{"name":"To","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromi